CAVEATS (see verification_and_validation/ring_rpt/ring_rpt_vs_openmc.md):
- the delta domain is now the same reflective SPHERE r = 3 the OpenMC
deck used, so the cube-corner FLiBe over-count no longer affects the
reported comparison; the cube rows are kept only to price it.
- explicit-TRISO delta resolves the 5 coating layers by nearest-centre
+ radius, not exact CSG.
- the RPT inner radius (1.4934 cm) was tuned by the deck author for
OpenMC, so it is not optimal here.
- Li-6(n,t) now counted (op-mzvp.2.10 fixed); tiny at 99.995 % Li-7.
- AI-assisted code-to-code check, not a validated result.
